{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to UtherWorld \u2014 the next evolution in adult social MMOs featuring a charming and fun Retro style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fully realized virtual world built for connection, creativity, and freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a world-leading team with 18 years of experience in online social platforms and virtual worlds, UtherWorld blends the thrill of meeting real people with the creativity of building and customizing your own space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In UtherWorld, every avatar is a real person, every outfit tells a story, and every moment is a chance to connect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here to meet new people, find romance, design stunning clothing, or build your dream property \u2014 UtherWorld gives you the tools (and the audience) to make it happen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes \u2014 you can even make money doing what you love. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/c8613f4e3bcd498a089e8e5d204c7876.avif?t=1761089511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras_big/c8613f4e3bcd498a089e8e5d204c7876.webp?t=1761089511 width=1560 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/18775274fdc2ac2e9db099606ae0fc5d.avif?t=1761089511\" width=720 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world buzzing with real personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat, flirt, dance and get sexy. Discover others from around the globe. Every avatar you meet is a real person looking to connect, collaborate, or simply have a good time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With robust in-game communication tools and a dynamic social scene, UtherWorld is where meaningful encounters begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/fb01ff91a9668d2c27325f6ff482133f.avif?t=1761089511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras_big/fb01ff91a9668d2c27325f6ff482133f.webp?t=1761089511 width=1560 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/f55c0f6bc2fd37721c6634ff34846b68.poster.avif?t=1761089511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/f55c0f6bc2fd37721c6634ff34846b68.webm?t=1761089511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/f55c0f6bc2fd37721c6634ff34846b68.mp4?t=1761089511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about chatting \u2014 it\u2019s about chemistry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on virtual dates, explore new places together, and build genuine relationships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your style is romantic, playful, or just social, UtherWorld gives you space to express yourself authentically and safely in an adult environment designed for real connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/971ae25f6473fe243e3ac84ba65a3192.avif?t=1761089511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras_big/971ae25f6473fe243e3ac84b